WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.575
Organise work into functions and save results to a text file.

00:00:05.575 --> 00:00:09.775
Return the greeting from a function, then write it with a context manager.

00:00:10.775 --> 00:00:13.602
Which file mode appends without truncating existing content?

00:00:13.602 --> 00:00:17.490
Mode a writes at the end, creating the file if needed.
